{"id":530,"mal_id":530,"title":"Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon","englishTitle":"Sailor Moon","title_english":"Sailor Moon","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Pretty Soldier Sailor Moon"],"en":"Sailor Moon","ja":"美少女戦士セーラームーン"},"synopsis":"Usagi Tsukino is an average student and crybaby klutz who constantly scores low on her tests. Unexpectedly, her humdrum life is turned upside down when she saves a cat with a crescent moon on its head from danger. The cat, named Luna, later reveals that their meeting was not an accident: Usagi is destined to become Sailor Moon, a planetary guardian with the power to protect the Earth. Given a special brooch that allows her to transform, she must use her new powers to save the city from evil energy-stealing monsters sent by the malevolent Queen Beryl of the Dark Kingdom.\n\nBut getting accustomed to her powers and fighting villains are not the only things she has to worry about. She must find the lost princess of the Moon Kingdom, the other Sailor Guardians, and the Legendary Silver Crystal in order to save the planet from destruction.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n","synopsis_es":"Usagi Tsukino es una estudiante promedio y una llorona torpe que constantemente obtiene puntuaciones bajas en sus exámenes. Inesperadamente, su aburrida vida da un vuelco cuando salva del peligro a un gato con una luna creciente en la cabeza. La gata, llamada Luna, revela más tarde que su encuentro no fue un accidente: Usagi está destinada a convertirse en Sailor Moon, una guardiana planetaria con el poder de proteger la Tierra. Dado un broche especial que le permite transformarse, debe usar sus nuevos poderes para salvar la ciudad de los malvados monstruos robadores de energía enviados por la malévola Reina Beryl del Reino Oscuro.\n\nPero acostumbrarse a sus poderes y luchar contra los villanos no son las únicas cosas por las que tiene que preocuparse. Debe encontrar a la princesa perdida del Reino de la Luna, a los otros Sailor Guardians y al legendario Cristal de Plata para salvar al planeta de la destrucción.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"1992-03-07","start_date":"1992-03-07","endDate":"1993-02-27","end_date":"1993-02-27","season":"spring","year":1992,"start_season":{"year":1992,"season":"spring"},"episodes":46,"num_episodes":46,"score":7.76,"mean":7.76,"numListUsers":422237,"num_list_users":422237,"genres":[{"id":66,"name":"Mahou Shoujo"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"},{"id":25,"name":"Shoujo"}],"studios":[{"id":18,"name":"Toei Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/92258.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/92258l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/92258.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/92258l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/92258l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"19:00","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"19:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 19:00"},"rank":1289,"popularity":655,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":204504,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2006-01-05T17:01:34+00:00","updated_at":"2025-02-16T12:53:14+00:00","source":"manga","background":"The series won the 1992 Animage's Anime Grand Prix Award.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":740,"title":"Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon R","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1/740.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1/740l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"sequel","relation_type_formatted":"Sequel"},{"node":{"id":8756,"title":"Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon Memorial","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cd